{"summary":"The acclaimed bridge-building indie-hit is back and better than ever!","description":"New levels, new mechanics, a custom physics engine, and much more! Rediscover your engineering creativity with even more hours of puzzling fun!\n\nAdrian Talens returns with a new full-length Soundtrack! Relax to the soothing and critically acclaimed music with 13 completely new tracks plus 18 of the original Poly Bridge songs remastered! Enjoy over an hour and a half of the familiar and gentle acoustic guitar rhythms.\n\nTake on levels with some added cushion and bounce your way to victory with the new Spring material. Now your bridges can be even more flexible!\n\nWe went above and beyond this time, crafting a custom physics engine optimized and fine-tuned specifically for bridge simulations. Accurate and predictable, it guarantees the same simulation outcome for everyone, keeping the competitive aspect of the game alive!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BbamVvVqR8I?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aRPDdHKr4W5pCIQB8HyAdZ1IiMXw8JVTOwMYtESi7_sjafqTTtCM8XVVS7AGhf9phrC9tE5hTdShGxGlNN2K","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ottYh2RhguNBjN-WeHhntiM5OtKAp7PDL12Wuz552tCERd-UYOVmQbqG2W6FLkjNr-Bl9F0mTrA_uWBxvN2cIMg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/AGR8d8Qva5mlkwWpAdpNXa48oZ86E5jVF1YR3nBjVXJwy3bdhwhQKvvn7wAi3o6nDwgM3RUMc9Jq2TmPbfBy","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VJY8EsnL0RPX5Hr2_oXONpaQfvg5zW3HO_fNl7eXUzOiL6uny69fVu1vxCeEwGrsZ_Mtj4ofNmVYYGokSxRB","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Qiu0_Ef4a7_tUOBfysaDd02lNxeenjGaapuI2NH4excVOF8xDOEh8GGlFn-Pda7BGLbcA2UOw24zPMlgu7l_hg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/d1-Qkcrv3k2BJ65fWzTdLRy6lQa7UPab2tVApCFlmM6rERz13dTVfVI8Kmt8RTJ2lmOQV6gX1ShNqxkoKmCHAQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/F6DmaxXymobKcB8pFUW_KXuWiJefyN0SVKPrZM06ajbT6lBI7fDzThrOlLd1d8LsVA6kcOcsx_RpRHxWSYe6","https://play-lh.go